 nights at $189/night, $378 total. It's the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. Before retrying, I checked Dana's reservations and found the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Retrying book_trip would have booked the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel on its own. The final reservation list shows exactly one confirmed flight and one confirmed hotel.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VWRQYPNYwDzuoxMcxnFbJP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014bvipVfTQisRhnDjosCyX5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Cheapest nonstop: F100 ($289). Cheapest hotel under $250/night: H1 Midtown Lodge ($378 total). Trip total $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013QB4Ckg36vHjjSPxF3xmUi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out; checking current state before any retry.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01H7a3MnmsCWRX74KA2Y8Bvr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinki